Grind Enchantments for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.1)

A port of Grind Enchantments 3.1.4 by mschae23.
Original source: https://github.com/mschae23/grind-enchantments
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-or-later

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-or-later); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the GNU LGPL v3 text; COPYING is the original jar's file (the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on).
